ng><coordinates>-84.5407924,39.1371341,0 -84.5406868,39.1371365,0 -84.5406509,39.1361669,0 -84.5407565,39.1361645,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-84.5407037,39.1361657,0 -84.5407396,39.1371353,0</coordinates></LineString></MultiGeometry></Placemark><Placemark><name>Burlington Street</name><description><![CDATA[layer: street<br>id: S22012<br>name: Burlington Street<br>kind: we_street<br>width_m: 9.14<br>width_ft: 30<br>width_src: printed (1922)<br>side: <br>src: Sanborn 1922<br>sheets: 22-34R<br>geom_src: 1922 Sanborn intersections<br>set: 1922<br>edited: false]]></description><styleUrl>#tee</styleUrl><MultiGeometry><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>-84.5384312,39.135892,0 -84.5385364,39.1359,0 -84.5383978,39.1370083,0 -84.5382926,39.1370003,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-84.5383452,39.1370043,0 -84.5384838,39.135896,0</coordinates></LineString></MultiGeometry></Placemark><Placemark><name>Ledlie Street</name><description><![CDATA[layer: street<br>id: S22013<br>name: Ledlie Street<br>kind: we_street<br>width_m: 9.14<br>width_ft: 30<br>width_src: printed (1922)<br>side: <br>src: Sanborn 1922<br>sheets: 22-34R<br>geom_src: 1922 Sanborn intersections<br>set: 1922<br>edited: false]]></description><styleUrl>#tee</styleUrl><MultiGeometry><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>-84.5414995,39.1446637,0 -84.5415043,39.1445815,0 -84.5423454,39.1446115,0 -84.5423405,39.1446938,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-84.5423429,39.1446527,0 -84.5415019,39.1446226,0</coordinates></LineString></MultiGeometry></Placemark><Placemark><name>Hopple Street</name><description><![CDATA[layer: street<br>id: S22014<br>name: Hopple Street<br>kind: we_street<br>width_m: 18.29<br>width_ft: 60<br>width_src: printed (1922)<br>side: <br>src: Sanborn 1922<br>sheets: 22-34L, 22-34R<br>geom_src: 1922 Sanborn intersections<br>set: 1922<br>note: on the line of the 1904 "Hopple (Bridge Av.)" from Meeker across Spring Grove, the deck's north lobe and Mill Creek to Beekman Street, at deck level since the north trunk became a viaduct (2026-10-14): Beekman 160.8 m, the deck about 158.9 m, Meeker 157.6 m. It passes 6.5 m under the trunk viaduct and TRI B/D's Camp Washington station, and RER A's viaduct crosses over it near Beekman (rail 168.2 m). Johnson's south end and Spring Grove meet it at grade<br>structure: deck level<br>edited: false]]></description><styleUrl>#tee</styleUrl><MultiGeometry><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>-84.5427153,39.137165,0 -84.546018,39.1374441,0 -84.5484196,39.137608,0 -84.5484011,39.1377721,0 -84.5459973,39.137608,0 -84.5426964,39.1373291,0 -84.5407318,39.1372198,0 -84.5407469,39.1370555,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-84.5407394,39.1371376,0 -84.5427058,39.1372471,0 -84.5460077,39.1375261,0 -84.5484103,39.1376901,0</coordinates></LineString></MultiGeometry></Placemark><Placemark><name>Ludlow Avenue</name><description><![CDATA[layer: street<br>id: S22015<br>name: Ludlow Avenue<br>kind: we_street<br>width_m: 18.29<br>width_ft: 60<br>width_src: printed (1922)<br>side: <br>src: Sanborn 1922<br>sheets: 22-37R<br>geom_src: 1922 Sanborn intersections<br>set: 1922<br>note: viaduct from Dodsworth Avenue (the 1904 name of its first block from Knowlton's Corner) over Mill Creek and the TRIMET north trunk (155.5 m, at grade; the 1922 street crossed the B&O at grade) to the old canal bank. Roadway at least 162.3 m over the trunk: about 3.5% up from Knowlton's Corner (149.4 m) along Dodsworth, then about 2% to the bank (163-166 m)<br>structure: viaduct<br>edited: false]]></description><styleUrl>#tee</styleUrl><MultiGeometry><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>-84.5379795,39.156294,0 -84.5381003,39.1